      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Williamson%2C_New_York",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Gates Hall, home to The Gatesinger Company Inc., is the oldest continuously operating community theater venue in the United States.",
